Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix: avoid Triton dependency in gated RMSNorm

Use the native NPU RMSNorm decomposition for ungrouped gated RMSNorm and preserve the upstream PyTorch implementation for grouped normalization.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
---
